  "models": {
    "delay": "Accepted 75-second parent disable (expiry or explicit removal) creates one independent infinite self-immobilizing child, with a one-second first pulse and current-source-max-HP pure damage. Rejection creates no disable callback. Controller retirement cancels future owned work.",
    "aura": "Global marked-ground-miner FogExist validator; live hidden source remains a provider. One canonical presence marker survives while any provider is present. Target death/retirement and final source retirement remove owned markers.",
    "cast": "Original Attack02 and Skill_01 hit/finish clocks. Ordinary attacks capture one marked ground miner. Skill AOE is centered at the captured input target at release, uses range_radius and damage_scale, and samples current selectable ground opponents. No input life is replaced after death. Separate normal/skill cooldowns; a ready unsilenced skill takes priority.",
    "limits": "Native selector-side, callback/FSM priority, radius-blackboard resolution, animation rate sampling and reset-at-cast-end are explicit shared-engine mappings. Buff event25 is independently corroborated as ON_BUFF_DISABLE against unchanged named source actions; this does not recover compiled methods."
